        "Parallel: Matt 18:22 — Jesus inverts Lamech",
        '<strong>Lamech\'s vengeance, Jesus\' forgiveness.</strong> Lamech boasts: "If Cain shall be avenged sevenfold, truly Lamech seventy-seven times." Jesus directly inverts this in <a href="index_split_051.html#ch-b60-c18">Matthew 18:21–22</a>: when Peter asks how often to forgive — "as many as seven times?" — Jesus replies "not seven times, but seventy-seven times." The numerical echo is unmistakable. Where Lamech\'s civilization is built on escalating vengeance, the kingdom is built on escalating forgiveness.',
