        "m",
        "",
        "comm",
        "Note",
        "Note",
        '<strong>Jacob and Esau as nations.</strong> The oracle telescopes individuals into peoples — Edom (Esau) and Israel (Jacob). "The older shall serve the younger" — Paul invokes this verse in Romans 9:12 as the paradigm of divine election independent of works. The reversal of birthright primogeniture is a recurring Genesis pattern (Cain/Abel, Ishmael/Isaac, Jacob/Esau, Manasseh/Ephraim, Reuben/Joseph).',
        "User original",
